  is a           box 0.40 by 0.20 by 0.04 m, 0.30 kg
  at             2.078243 m along, 0 m to the left, 0.14 m up
  turns on       flap1 hinge, about y, at flap1 pivot
  swings         from -90° to -25°
  starts turned  -90°
  damping        0.04 N·m·s/rad
  friction       0.68
  bounce         dead
  colour         wood

